To every dancer I had the privilege of working with this summer—thank you for helping me grow as a teacher and mentor to young, aspiring artists. And to their coaches, thank you for trusting me with your programs and your amazing athletes. I can’t wait to see how much growth and magic is still ahead this season ✨

